.DS_Store
*.swp

# Agent tooling state. Note this also keeps .claude/skills/ local: a project
# skill committed here would be shared with every clone, and this is the choice
# not to. Ignored rather than merely untracked because it is one `git add -A`
# away from riding along into a commit.
#
# NOT .idea/, which is tracked here on purpose — the icon's design canvas lives
# in .idea/design/app-icon/ and is the provenance for design/armada-mark.svg.
.claude

# Except the canvas's uploads/: bastion's and cupertino's brand kits, dropped in
# as reference while the icon was drawn. They are those apps' artwork rather than
# this repo's, and this repo is public. The canvas itself, its support.js runtime
# and its .thumbnail stay tracked, because it cannot open without them. Untracked
# on 2026-09-14, not purged: the files are still in the history before that.
.idea/design/app-icon/uploads/

# Xcode
apps/apple/.build/
DerivedData/
xcuserdata/
*.xcuserstate
*.moved-aside
*.hmap
*.dSYM

# SwiftPM. A local package's own build tree, from `make test`, sits beside its
# manifest rather than under apps/apple/.build.
.swiftpm/
apps/apple/Packages/*/.build/

# Direct distribution. Vendor/ is fetched and checksummed by `make sparkle` rather
# than committed. The rest is key material, and this repo is public: a Developer ID
# certificate, an App Store Connect key, or the Sparkle private key exported for CI
# is one `git add -A` away from being published to everyone.
apps/apple/Vendor/
sparkle_key.pem
*.p8
*.p12

# The licence signing key lives in the root .env, and the Worker's secrets are
# staged in apps/api/.<env>.vars before `pnpm secrets:prod` pushes them. Their
# .example templates are tracked; the files themselves never are.
#
# Globbed rather than listed, which is bastion's lesson: its list named .dev.vars
# and .prod.vars and missed .test.vars, which carries the signing key too — the one
# secret that cannot be rotated without refusing every key ever issued.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.vars
!*.vars.example
# A project MCP config carries the bearer token of Armada's own endpoint.
.mcp.json

# Node
node_modules/
dist/
.astro/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Wrangler's local state, including the miniflare D1 the Worker tests run against.
.wrangler/
